Third-party components
----------------------

The plugin bundles prebuilt binaries of "opencode2api" (GPL-3.0-or-later):

  Project: https://github.com/jasonxu114514/opencode2api
  Pinned commit: 0bb23c7
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  License copy: src/main/resources/META-INF/third-party/opencode2api/LICENSE

Source code for the bundled binaries can be obtained from the project URL
above at the pinned commit. The binaries are started as a separate local
process and are not linked into the plugin's Java code.
